OL,3,AGhanaian twin brothers and US woman
OL,4,Aplead guilty to $9m romance scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwin brothers from Ghana and an
OL,7,FAmerican woman have pleaded guilty to
OL,8,Fcharges of being part of an
OL,9,Finternational criminal network which
OL,10,Fdefrauded people they met on dating
OL,11,Fsites and social media.
OL,13,FThe group targeted elderly people in
OL,14,Fthe US and Europe, using fake
OL,15,Fidentities to lure their victims into
OL,16,Fbelieving they were in a romantic
OL,17,Frelationship, before persuading them to
OL,18,Ftransfer large sums of money into bank
OL,19,Faccounts in Ghana.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
